// PSS v3.0 LRM — Example 187: Illustration of behavioral coverage concepts (page 258)
action read {}
action write {}
action idle {}
action send {}
action receive {}
monitor m1 {
  write w;
  read r;
  activity {
    w;
    r;
  }
}
monitor m2 {
  activity {
    do write;
    select {
      do read;
      do send;
    };
    do receive;
  }
}

monitor m3 {
  activity {
    select {
      do write;
      do read;
    };
    select {
      do send;
      do receive;
    };
  }
}
c1: cover m1;
c2: cover m3;

The monitors m1, m2, and m3 define the following scenarios:
—
